      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The value of each key in `automaticallyLoadedAssetKeys` will automatically be loaded by the [`asset`](avplayeritem/asset.md) prior to the player item reaching a status of [`AVPlayerItem.Status.readyToPlay`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum/readytoplay.md).",
